  "reasoning": "The defendant knowingly purchased prohibited cultural relics and attempted to resell them for profit, which constitutes illegal buying and selling of cultural relics under Chinese law. Additionally, he deceived the victim by promising high returns from the sale of these relics, obtained 5 million RMB, and misused the funds, which meets the elements of fraud. Therefore the appropriate charges are illegal trade of cultural relics and fraud.",
